  "description": "An autumn inspired digital scrapbook paper set featuring hand painted watercolors of leaves, foliage, wild berries, and mushrooms. This pack of 10 seamless repeating patterns come in shades of brown, beige, warm reds, and greens. Use them in a myriad of craft projects and business graphics, such as origami, fabric patterns, gift wrap, web and zoom backdrops, wedding invitations, decorative collage, and the like.\nThe images in this set are hand drawn by me in digital and in watercolor. You can find these individual illustrations and other botanical fruit art in my shop.\nINCLUDES:\n10 individual jpgs in 300dpi format, measuring 12×12 inches, or 3600×3600 pixels.\nFeel free to check out other watercolor botanical patterns and clipart in my shop!",
